WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.482
Pig had a new kite.

2
00:00:09.483 --> 00:00:14.030
But there was no wind.

3
00:00:14.031 --> 00:00:24.520
"I can't fly my kite," said Pig.

4
00:00:24.521 --> 00:00:32.247
The next day a wind blew.

5
00:00:32.248 --> 00:00:35.734
"Yay!" said Pig.

6
00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:40.342
"I will fly my kite."

7
00:00:40.343 --> 00:00:47.376
Pig went to the barn.

8
00:00:47.377 --> 00:00:50.582
He got his kite.

9
00:00:50.583 --> 00:00:54.997
He ran with it.

10
00:00:54.998 --> 00:00:58.313
But the wind stopped.

11
00:00:58.314 --> 00:01:03.992
The kite dragged on the ground.

12
00:01:03.993 --> 00:01:07.437
"Oh," said Pig.

13
00:01:07.438 --> 00:01:21.559
Pig put the kite back in the barn.

14
00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:25.737
He lay down in the mud.

15
00:01:25.738 --> 00:01:31.366
The wind blew again.

16
00:01:31.367 --> 00:01:34.365
"Yay!" said Pig.

17
00:01:34.366 --> 00:01:37.613
Pig went back to the barn.

18
00:01:37.614 --> 00:01:41.339
He got his kite.

19
00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:45.575
He ran with it.

20
00:01:45.576 --> 00:01:49.783
But the wind stopped again.

21
00:01:49.784 --> 00:01:54.793
The kite bumped along the ground.

22
00:01:54.794 --> 00:02:00.028
"Ugh," said Pig.

